  "title": "· New Bags | Miu Miu Presents Spring/Summer 2027 Runway Show: Here and Now ·",
  "original_title": "新包 | Miu Miu 发布2027春夏时装秀：此时此地",
  "excerpt": "Miu Miu’s Spring/Summer 2027 Paris show blended everyday sportswear and vintage pieces with formal tailoring, creating a rebellious dialogue of collision and tension.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
