    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Miu Miu's Spring/Summer 2027 show has just wrapped at the Palais d'Iéna in Paris. Titled \"Here and Now,\" the collection sees creative director Miuccia Prada layering everyday staples—sportswear, knitwear, leather jackets and vintage pieces—with formalwear such as tailored suits, shirt-style tops and embroidered evening gowns, creating a deliberate, rebellious dialogue that explores the expression of collision and tension.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
