    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "I've always wanted to find a way to inject beauty into these clothes that truly serve life. It's just that before, I never managed to do it with such precision, nor push it to this depth. Today's clothing is already a fusion of sportswear, casualwear and everyday wear. How to make clothes more interesting and richer? Blending sporty elements with refined textures—this idea has always influenced my work. — Miuccia Prada",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
