      "type": "heading",
      "text": "· Flap Bags ·",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Vividly colored python skin runs throughout the collection. The new flap bags take a vintage messenger silhouette with strap-style closures, rendered in bright shades of olive green, purple, orange and blue for a style that's rebellious yet pretty.",
