    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The new Retour bag draws inspiration from the classic duffle travel bag, featuring a vintage rectangular silhouette with tonal leather piping. The body comes in a variety of materials—distressed leather, python and solid calfskin—and is offered in a petite, refined hand-carry style as well as an oversized travel-bag size. The elongated lines and structured shape strike a clever balance between sweet and cool.",
